# Protected paths (docs/HYBRID-WORKFLOW.md; approved plan, section 5).
#
# A branch that changes any of these needs an architect approval: the line
#   Architect-Approved: yes
# in the pull request description (or, locally, RENGA_ARCHITECT_APPROVED=yes).
# tools/renga/renga-guard enforces it in the pre-push hook and the PR check.
# This is a process control against accidents, not a security boundary.
#
# Format: one repository-relative path prefix per line. A prefix ending in
# "/" matches everything below that directory; any other entry matches that
# exact file or anything that starts with it. "#" starts a comment.
# Special entry: "RENGA_MASTER_ROADMAP.md#decisions" protects only the
# decision entries of the roadmap (section 10.3 "Decisions log"), not the
# rest of the file.

